{"seq":3,"slug":"loop-optimizations","title":"循环优化","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/code-optimization-codegen/optimizations/loop-optimizations","wordCount":1742,"readingTime":7,"html":"<h1 id=\"循环优化\">循环优化</h1><p>一个程序 90% 的运行时间常常花在 10% 的代码上，而这 10% 几乎总是循环。所以编译器对循环格外用力：把每次迭代都重算却结果不变的东西提到循环外、把昂贵的乘法换成迭代里廉价的加法、把循环体复制几份以摊薄跳转开销并暴露并行、重排循环维度让访存更贴合缓存。这些循环优化往往是整条流水线里单项收益最大的，但它们也最依赖<a href=\"../ir-analysis/control-flow-analysis\">控制流分析</a>识别出的精确循环结构。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>循环优化的工作单元是<a href=\"../ir-analysis/control-flow-analysis\">控制流分析</a>识别出的自然循环，关键角色是循环头、回边、前置头块（preheader）和归纳变量。下表概览本篇的主要变换。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>变换</th>\n<th>核心动作</th>\n<th>前提条件</th>\n<th>收益</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>循环不变量外提 LICM</td>\n<td>把不变计算移到前置头块</td>\n<td>该计算在循环内值不变</td>\n<td>减少重复计算</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>强度削减</td>\n<td>用加法替代每次迭代的乘法</td>\n<td>识别出归纳变量</td>\n<td>廉价指令替代昂贵指令</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>归纳变量消除</td>\n<td>删除冗余归纳变量</td>\n<td>多个归纳变量线性相关</td>\n<td>减少寄存器压力</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>循环展开</td>\n<td>复制循环体 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>k</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">k</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span></span> 份</td>\n<td>已知或可估计迭代次数</td>\n<td>减少跳转、暴露并行</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>循环交换</td>\n<td>交换嵌套循环顺序</td>\n<td>不违反数据依赖</td>\n<td>改善缓存局部性</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>循环分块</td>\n<td>把迭代空间切成小块</td>\n<td>大数组访存</td>\n<td>提升缓存复用</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;  A[&quot;识别自然循环&lt;br/&gt;(来自控制流分析)&quot;] --&gt; B[&quot;插入前置头块 preheader&quot;]&#10;  B --&gt; C[&quot;循环不变量外提 LICM&quot;]&#10;  C --&gt; D[&quot;归纳变量识别&quot;]&#10;  D --&gt; E[&quot;强度削减 + 归纳变量消除&quot;]&#10;  E --&gt; F[&quot;循环展开&quot;]&#10;  F --&gt; G[&quot;循环交换 / 分块 (访存优化)&quot;]&#10;  G --&gt; H[&quot;送往向量化&quot;]\">flowchart TD\n  A[\"识别自然循环&lt;br/&gt;(来自控制流分析)\"] --&gt; B[\"插入前置头块 preheader\"]\n  B --&gt; C[\"循环不变量外提 LICM\"]\n  C --&gt; D[\"归纳变量识别\"]\n  D --&gt; E[\"强度削减 + 归纳变量消除\"]\n  E --&gt; F[\"循环展开\"]\n  F --&gt; G[\"循环交换 / 分块 (访存优化)\"]\n  G --&gt; H[\"送往向量化\"]</pre><h2 id=\"循环不变量外提\">循环不变量外提</h2><p>如果一段计算在循环的每次迭代里都产生相同的值，那么把它留在循环里就是纯粹的浪费。循环不变量外提（Loop-Invariant Code Motion, LICM）把这种计算提到循环之外、只算一次。判断「不变」靠<a href=\"../ir-analysis/dataflow-analysis\">数据流分析</a>：一个表达式是不变的，当它的所有操作数要么是循环外定义的、要么本身也是不变的，递归到不动点。</p>\n<p>外提的落点是前置头块——<a href=\"../ir-analysis/control-flow-analysis\">控制流分析</a>在循环头之前专门插入的一个块，保证只在进入循环前执行一次。但 LICM 必须谨慎：被外提的计算如果有副作用或可能抛异常（如除法、内存访问），就不能无条件外提，否则会改变程序在「循环执行零次」时的行为。这是循环优化里语义安全的常见陷阱。</p>\n<h2 id=\"强度削减与归纳变量\">强度削减与归纳变量</h2><p>强度削减（strength reduction）的思想是：用循环里廉价的运算替代昂贵的运算。最经典的场景围绕归纳变量——那些每次迭代按固定步长线性变化的变量，典型如循环计数器 <code>i</code>。考虑数组访问 <code>a[i]</code>，地址是 <code>base + i * 4</code>，循环里每次都要做一次乘法。识别出 <code>i</code> 是归纳变量后，可以引入一个新变量 <code>j = base + i * 4</code>，并把每次迭代的乘法换成 <code>j = j + 4</code> 这样一次加法。</p>\n<p>形式化地，若归纳变量 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>i</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">i</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6595em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">i</span></span></span></span></span> 满足 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>i</mi><mrow><mi>k</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>i</mi><mi>k</mi></msub><mo>+</mo><mi>c</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">i_{k+1} = i_k + c</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8679em;vertical-align:-0.2083em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">i</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span><span class=\"mbin mtight\">+</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2083em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8095em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">i</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span></span></span></span></span>，则任何线性派生量 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>j</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>a</mi><mo>⋅</mo><mi>i</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>b</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">j = a \\cdot i + b</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.854em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0572em;\">j</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4445em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">a</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7429em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">i</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">b</span></span></span></span></span> 也满足 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>j</mi><mrow><mi>k</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>j</mi><mi>k</mi></msub><mo>+</mo><mi>a</mi><mo>⋅</mo><mi>c</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">j_{k+1} = j_k + a \\cdot c</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8679em;vertical-align:-0.2083em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0572em;\">j</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0572em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span><span class=\"mbin mtight\">+</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2083em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.854em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0572em;\">j</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0572em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4445em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">a</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span></span></span></span></span>，于是 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>j</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">j</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.854em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0572em;\">j</span></span></span></span></span> 的更新从一次乘加退化为一次加法。强度削减常与归纳变量消除联动：当强度削减后原归纳变量只用于计算派生量时，原变量本身可被删除，进一步降低寄存器压力。</p>\n<h2 id=\"循环展开\">循环展开</h2><p>循环展开（loop unrolling）把循环体复制 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>k</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">k</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span></span> 份，使每轮迭代处理 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>k</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">k</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span></span> 个原迭代的工作，迭代次数相应减为约 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>1</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mi>k</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">1/k</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1/</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span></span>。它带来三重收益：跳转和循环条件判断的次数减少；相邻迭代的指令被放进同一个块，给<a href=\"../codegen/instruction-scheduling\">指令调度</a>更大的重排空间来隐藏延迟；最重要的是，展开后多份独立的迭代体暴露出数据级并行，为<a href=\"../advanced/autovectorization\">自动向量化</a>提供原料。</p>\n<p>代价是代码膨胀和指令缓存压力，所以展开因子要权衡。当迭代次数不能被 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>k</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">k</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span></span> 整除时，还需生成一段处理「余数」的尾循环。现代编译器（如 LLVM 的 LoopUnroll pass）会基于循环体大小和估计的迭代次数自动决定是否展开以及展开多少。</p>\n<h2 id=\"访存导向的循环变换\">访存导向的循环变换</h2><p>对操作大数组的循环，性能瓶颈往往不是计算而是缓存命中率，于是有一类专门改善访存局部性的变换。循环交换（loop interchange）交换嵌套循环的内外层顺序，让最内层循环沿数组在内存中连续的维度遍历，把跨步访问变成顺序访问，大幅提升缓存命中。循环分块（loop tiling / blocking）把大的迭代空间切成能装进缓存的小块，让一块数据在被换出前被充分复用——矩阵乘法的分块是教科书级例子。这两种变换都必须先做依赖分析确认重排不破坏数据依赖，否则会改变结果。</p>\n<h2 id=\"循环优化的相互依赖\">循环优化的相互依赖</h2><p>这些循环变换很少单独起作用，它们往往互为前提、需要按合理顺序编排。LICM 把不变量外提后，循环体里剩下的常常就是纯粹的归纳变量更新，这恰好为强度削减创造了清晰的工作对象；强度削减引入新的派生归纳变量后，归纳变量消除才有冗余可删；循环展开则把多份迭代摊平，既给<a href=\"../codegen/instruction-scheduling\">指令调度</a>更大重排空间，又给<a href=\"../advanced/autovectorization\">自动向量化</a>暴露相邻同构运算。</p>\n<p>顺序错了会互相妨碍：若先展开再做 LICM，外提的判断要在膨胀后的更大循环体上做，分析成本上升；若访存变换（交换、分块）放在向量化之后，又可能破坏已经成形的向量访存模式。所以工业编译器（如 LLVM 的循环 pass 流水线）对这些变换的先后顺序有精心设计的编排，并常常多趟运行、配合<a href=\"../ir-analysis/dataflow-analysis\">数据流分析</a>反复刷新事实。理解单个变换不难，难的是理解它们如何咬合成一条产生最大收益的链。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>程序运行时间高度集中在循环，循环优化常是单项收益最大的变换，但高度依赖<a href=\"../ir-analysis/control-flow-analysis\">控制流分析</a>识别的循环结构。</li>\n<li>LICM 把循环不变计算外提到前置头块只算一次，但对有副作用的计算必须谨慎以保语义。</li>\n<li>强度削减用归纳变量的加法替代每次迭代的乘法，常与归纳变量消除联动降低寄存器压力。</li>\n<li>循环展开减少跳转、扩大<a href=\"../codegen/instruction-scheduling\">指令调度</a>空间，并为<a href=\"../advanced/autovectorization\">自动向量化</a>暴露并行。</li>\n<li>循环交换与分块改善缓存局部性，前提是依赖分析确认重排安全。</li>\n<li>优化后的循环 IR 会继续送往<a href=\"../codegen/\">代码生成</a>与第四章的向量化。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"循环优化","id":"循环优化"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"循环不变量外提","id":"循环不变量外提"},{"level":2,"text":"强度削减与归纳变量","id":"强度削减与归纳变量"},{"level":2,"text":"循环展开","id":"循环展开"},{"level":2,"text":"访存导向的循环变换","id":"访存导向的循环变换"},{"level":2,"text":"循环优化的相互依赖","id":"循环优化的相互依赖"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"全局优化","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/code-optimization-codegen/optimizations/global-optimizations"},"next":{"title":"指令选择","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/code-optimization-codegen/codegen/instruction-selection"}}